              "label": "Optical depth of field",
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "type": "example",
                  "example": "labs/pg-depth-of-field"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "BlurPass implements separable filtering with intermediate targets. PostProcessPass applies a full-screen shader to an input handle and exposes presentationOutput. Scene blur animations and camera depth of field are different mechanisms: blur changes an image or entity effect, while ray-trace depth of field samples a lens/focal plane."
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Exact contracts: [BlurPass](/api-render-passes#blurpass), [PostProcessPass](/api-render-passes#postprocesspass), [BlurIn](/api-animation#blurin), [BlurOut](/api-animation#blurout), [BlurPulse](/api-animation#blurpulse), [BlurTarget](/api-animation#blurtarget), [BlurTo](/api-animation#blurto)."
        }
      ]
    },
